  "description": "This repository hosts the official implementation of the Floquet-QNM Framework, a paradigm-shifting approach for modeling open, non-Hermitian, and time-varying photonic systems.  By leveraging a static Quasinormal Mode (QNM) basis, this solver bypasses the traditional bottlenecks of time-discretization, achieving fast and accurate simulation.",
